---
title: Before (P09, --no-queue) - the confirmation email is sent inside the booking request
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant API as api.py reserve (thread pool)
  participant UoW as unit of work (main.py)
  participant BS as BookingService.reserve
  participant DB as SQLite / PostgreSQL
  participant Mail as EmailNotificationSender (HOTEL_EMAIL_SECONDS=1)

  Guest->>API: POST /reservations (R7, one night in December)
  API->>UoW: with unit_of_work() as service
  UoW->>BS: reserve(guest, room, stay)
  BS->>DB: has_overlap (pre-check) - about 1 ms
  BS->>DB: next_reservation_id + INSERT (exclusion constraint / trigger) - about 1 ms
  Note over BS,DB: the room is the guest's from here on (not committed yet)
  BS->>Mail: send_confirmation(Confirmation)
  Note over BS,Mail: the request waits a full second for the mail server
  Mail-->>BS: returns after 1 s
  BS-->>UoW: BookingResult Accepted
  UoW->>DB: save_changes + COMMIT (SQLite write lock held for the whole second)
  UoW-->>API: result
  API-->>Guest: 201 Created after about 1 s (measured: see docs/queue-trace.md)
